{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectral Asylum: Echoes of The Forgotten pays homage to the original Slender The Eight Pages, and contains elements of Slender The Arrival alongside the Backrooms with its atmospheric locations and eerie notes for story telling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in an abandoned asylum, located in the [REDACTED]. A <span class=\"bb_strike\">reality</span> separate from our own. You play as Nia Varinian, a senior in high school who's parents run a well known pharmaceutical company known as Echo Corp. While Echo Corp is wildly praised for its break throughs in medical technology and creating new opportunities for its patients, it also houses a bit of a questionable background. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missing persons cases seem to emerge every 6 months, all of which linking to the establishment, even Nia's parents, the owners have vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it's up to you to find them and uncover the sinister secrets behind Echo Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the horrific entities that await, uncover the secrets of Echo Corp\u00a0in this spine chilling experience!\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089380/extras/7087b06a12e37c1abb7fc62e18d255bf.avif?t=1762117740\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WISHLIST NOW and stay up-to-date regarding this exciting new horror title!\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089380/extras/4d699bb3746fbd745097ab2da7ebaeb2.poster.avif?t=1762117740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089380/extras/4d699bb3746fbd745097ab2da7ebaeb2.webm?t=1762117740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati